  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your subsequent attacks continue to be infused with psionic energy.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Psionic Fist OR Psionic Shot OR Psionic Weapon.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When expending your psionic focus while using either the Psionic Fist, Psionic Shot, or Psionic Weapon feat, all attacks made during that round gain the additional damage from expending psionic focus.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-psionic-feats#toc2\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
